# Implementation Plan: `Dispute` Bounded Context

This document is written to be executed by an agent (Claude Code). Tasks are ordered by dependency;
each is scoped to a single session. The "Provider Reference" section at the end is verified ground
truth — **do not invent endpoints or fields outside of it; if in doubt, stop and ask**.

Facts in the reference were verified against public documentation on 2026-08-07. Nuvei REST 2.0 is
marked beta — confirm availability on the production accounts before starting F4/F9.

**Revised 2026-08-07** against the actual repository: layout corrected to the package monorepo,
tasks that belong to the consuming application split out into Part II, and the Nuvei checksum task
reduced to what is not already implemented.

